  m_Name: TutorialLevel5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialDataSO
  pages:
  - Merge joins two numbers side by side.
  - 'Order matters in merge.

    Select 1, then 2 you get 12.

    Select 2, then
    1 you get 21.'
  - You can't merge two two digit numbers together.
  - The red slots on the calendar are weekends. You don't work on those days, so
    no pins appear.
